  (text "Unused GPIOs (PC13-15, PA3-4, PA7, PA10, PB2, PB4, PB5, PB10, PC6, PC7, PC12, PD2):\n10k pull-down to GND each (R90-R105). PA4 is kept free for DAC1_OUT1 (Test_pin_DAC).\nPA2 = VIN_PWM (TIM15_CH1 PWM input, VIN monitor from the primary); R93 is its pull-down."
    (at 129.54 203.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid bf127b86-779a-42e7-870c-ce5b474d14f1)
  )

